    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the office, <strong>Florence</strong>.<br>Everyone else has been fired, now it's just you\u2026 and the tireless mechanical workers serving the company and its shareholders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task? Fetch more documents. Always more. The robots follow orders well, but some files remain lost in the chaos of this decaying earlys 1900's bureaucracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into piles of paperwork, unravel office secrets, and navigate the absurd demands of a system gone mad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The machines can obey.</strong><br><strong>But can </strong><strong><i>you</i></strong><strong>, a human, meet the standard?</strong></p>",
